From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anxelok <anxelok@localhost>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 19:11:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Use cooperative region dispatch

Let tick coordinators participate in fair region batches while preserving phase barriers and deterministic failure handling.

